:: Prison Wren Escape 2
<<effects>>
<<badEndTrackingEnd "Prison" { reason: "prisonWren" }>>
<<earnFeat "Not Meant to be Caged">>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	당신은 렌에게 기댄다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 더 꽉 껴안고 웃는다. "너무 쉽게 넘어오진 마." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "난 쫓는 걸 좋아하거든." 안개가 배를 감싼다.
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	당신은 렌에게서 몸을 뺀다. <<He>>【이가】 웃는다. "꽉 잡기나 해." 안개가 배를 감싼다.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
	안개가 배를 감싸는 동안 당신은 가만히 있는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $transformationParts.traits.sharpEyes isnot "disabled">>
	앞쪽 안개 속에서 뾰족한 바위들이 불쑥 솟아 있다. 렌은 아랑곳하지 않고 각각의 바위를 피해 배를 몬다.
<<else>>
	렌은 마치 기억에 의존하는 듯, 보이지 않는 뾰족한 바위들을 피해 배를 몬다. 양옆으로 하늘 높이 솟은 바위들을 언뜻 볼 수 있다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

At last, the ship breaches the other side. The air clears around you.

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<if !Weather.isOvercast>>
		마을의 불빛이 지평선을 밝히는 것이 보인다.
	<<else>>
		그렇다 해도, 어둠 속에서 멀리까지는 보이지 않는다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	수평선 너머로 마을이 보인다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"내가 뭐라고 했어?" <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "이걸로 세 번 연속 안전하게 통과했네."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Wren Escape 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Wren Escape 3
<<location "docks">><<effects>>

The ship makes good time, and soon approaches the coast. Wren guides it towards the dock, glancing back at the mist once.
<br><br>

"I hope this is a good landing spot for you," <<he>> says, pulling up at the pier. "I have elsewhere to be." <<He>> grins. You step ashore, salt still drying on your skin.
<br><br>

"곧 다시 보길 바라." <<He>>【은는】 다시 넓은 바다를 향해 배를 몬다.
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Docks]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Beach Wren Ask
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	<<gagged_speech "저-저도 데려가 주실 수 있나요?">> 당신이 묻는다. <<gagged_speech "당신 배에요.">>
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	<<gagged_speech "Could I trouble you for passage?">> you ask. <<gagged_speech "On your boat.">>
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	<<gagged_speech "Could you take me with you?">> you ask. <<gagged_speech "I'll do what I can in return.">>
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	<<gagged_speech "저도 좀 태워 주시면 좋겠는데,">> 당신이 말한다. <<gagged_speech "뭘 해 드리면 되죠?">>
<<else>>
	<<gagged_speech "저도 데려가 주실 수 있나요?">> 당신이 묻는다. <<gagged_speech "분명 뭔가 드릴 수 있을 거예요.">>
<</if>>
<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	<<He>>【이가】 당신이 하려는 말을 알아들은 듯 낄낄 웃는다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Wren rubs <<his>> chin. "There is something I need," <<he>> says. "<span class="gold">The names of the guards,</span> and one of the prisoners. <span class="gold">The scarred one.</span> Names have value here. They open doors, close mouths, and make people nervous."
<br><br>
<<generate_anxious_guard 1>>
<span class="lblue">"초조한 경비원 이름은 이미 알고 있어."</span> <<he>>【이가】 씩 웃으며 덧붙인다. "그러니 그건 신경 쓰지 마. 카드 게임에서 땄거든. <<person2>><<He>>【은는】 달리 내놓을 게 없었지."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Beach]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Beach Wren Names
<<effects>>

<<unset $prison_wren_relaxed>>
<<unset $prison_wren_scarred>>
<<unset $prison_wren_veteran>>
<<unset $prison_wren_methodical>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"Th-That's all the names," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"That's all of them," you say, barely above the waves.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"That should be everyone you asked for," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I gave you every name I could," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"That's your list," you say. "Better be worth it."
<<else>>
	"That's all the names," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"좋아." 렌이 손뼉을 치며 말한다. "큰 도움이 됐어."


<<if $prison.watchers_friend is 2>>
	<<He>>【이가】 하늘을 쳐다본다. <span class="green">"새들도 당신이 여기 나와 있는 걸 신경 쓰지 않는 것 같군."</span> <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "준비되면 알려줘."
<<elseif $prison.schedule is "revolt">>
	<<He>>【이가】 하늘을 쳐다본다. <span class="green">"새들이 바쁘군."</span> <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "지금이 기회야."
<<else>>
	<<He>> points at the sky. "<span class="blue">There's one problem left.</span> The birds. Hiding below deck won't work. Tried that once. You gotta get them friendly with you, or distract them somehow."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Beach]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

