:: Prison Beach Escape
<<effects>>

You wade out, until a wave lifts your feet from the sand. Cold water grips your ribs. It is gentle at first,
<<if currentSkillValue('swimmingskill') gte 1000>>
	but you soon have to struggle to remain above the surface. You fight the pull of the tide, <span class="green">until the water calms.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if $prison.schedule is "revolt">>
		Nothing bothers you as you swim. <span class="green">The watchers are distracted by the other inmates.</span> Their cries fade behind the surf.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Prison Beach Escape 2]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $prison.watchers_friend is 2>>
		You hear the beating of wings. <<beastNEWinit 2 hawk>>Two <<beastsplural>> circle overhead, <span class="green">but then fly towards the spire.</span> They won't bother you, though you keep glancing up until they vanish.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Prison Beach Escape 2]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You hear the beating of wings. <<beastNEWinit 2 hawk>><span class="red">A <<beasttype>> swoops towards you.</span> You try to shelter beneath the surface, but <<bhis>> talons find you. <<bHe>> lifts you into the air, spray falling from your body, and dumps you back on the beach.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Prison Beach]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">그러다 갑자기 당신을 붙잡아 수면 아래로 끌고 들어간다.</span> 당신은 발길질하고 몸부림치지만 소용없다.
	<br><br>

	The journey is short, but terrifying. You cough up seawater, and are left washed up where you started.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Prison Beach]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Prison Beach Escape 2
<<set $location to "sea">><<effects>>
You keep swimming, until you reach the ring of mist that encircles the island. The prison is behind you, the open sea ahead. This is the point of no return.
<br><br>

<<link [[탈출 (0:30)|Prison Escape]]>><<prison_end>><<prisoncrimeUp>><<pass 30>><<prison_guards -40>><</link>><<gggcrime>><<gggsuspicion>>
<br>
<<link [[감옥으로 헤엄쳐 돌아간다 (0:05)|Prison Beach]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Escape
<<effects>>
<<badEndTrackingEnd "Prison" { reason: "prisonSwimming" }>>
<<earnFeat "Not Meant to be Caged">>
당신은 섬과 그 감옥을 뒤로하고 헤엄쳐 나간다. 안개 속에서 바위들이 불쑥 솟아 있다. 배에게는 위험하지만, 당신에게는 아니다.

<<prison_bondage_removal>>
<<if _punishments_removed is true>>
	당신은 뾰족한 모서리를 이용해 감옥의 구속구를 잘라내기까지 한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You remain confident you're swimming in the right direction, despite the lack of landmarks. Your arms ache, your breath burns, and still you keep going. At last, the mist clears.
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<if !Weather.isOvercast>>
		밤하늘을 배경으로 불 켜진 마을이 지평선에 나타난다.
	<<else>>
		밤의 어둠 속에서는 멀리까지 보이지 않는다.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	마을이 지평선에 나타난다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Sea]]>><<set $sea to 100>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Beach Swim
<<effects>>

<<if $exposed lt 2>>
	You remove your clothes, and swim around the lagoon. The water is cold enough to make you gasp, then bearable once you start moving.
<<else>>
	You swim around the lagoon. The prison feels distant for a few minutes, though never distant enough.
<</if>>
<<strip>>
<<water>>
<<waterbr 2>>

<<if $rng gte 81>>
	작은 물고기들이 거리를 둔다.
<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
	작은 물고기들이 당신 위로 뛰어오른다.
<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
	해초 가닥들이 당신의 배를 어루만진다.
<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
	Several pebbles roll off the surrounding rocks, splashing into the water beside you.
<<else>>
	A particularly large wave breaches the lagoon, lifting you before letting you drop back into calmer water.
<</if>>

<<swimmingskilluse>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Prison Beach]]>><<clotheson>><</link>>
